  The whole app is right-to-left: `android:supportsRtl="true"` is set in the
  manifest, Compose mirrors layouts automatically from the layout direction, and
  the back arrow / chevron vectors are auto-mirrored.

  Number ranges are written as "من X إلى Y" instead of "X–Y" so bidirectional
  text cannot reorder the digits. The brand name stays in Latin script.
-->
